1) The class is self-dual in respect to the duality operation;
2) It is for subsets of this class, their duals exhibit non-isomorphic properties from one another;
3) It is for subsets of this class, their subsets exhibit containment relationship under isomorphism;
4) It is for subsets of this class, their hypergraph rank exhibits a constant value.
This class consists precisely of uniform hypergraphs corresponding to non-deenerate projective geometries of specific dimensions.
